# Plan Preferences

When using `spec-driven-development`, save all plans to:

`{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/Documents/dev-plans/<repo-name>/specs/YYYY-MM-DD-<feature-name>.md`

Save all plans and their task checklists to:

`{{ .chezmoi.homeDir }}/Documents/dev-plans/<repo-name>/plans/YYYY-MM-DD-<feature-name>.md`

Write the plan and its task checklist into the single plan file. Do not create repo-local `specs/` or `docs/plans/`
directories unless the user explicitly asks for them. These paths override the defaults in `spec-driven-development`.
